        {
          "path": "_m/r/7/h/g/the-old-windmill-brisbane-wp/statelibqld-2-201211-observato.jpg",
          "filename": "StateLibQld 2 201211 Observatory, Wickham Terrace, Brisbane, Queensland, ca. 1908.jpg",
          "caption": "Observatory, Wickham Terrace, Brisbane, Queensland, ca. 1908.\nThe old windmill observatory on Wickham Terrace, Brisbane, around 1908. Four flags are flying on the mast in front of the mill. A lamp post and telegraph pole can be seen on the opposite corner. Copied from a postcard, the back of which reads: 'Dear Sister, Just a P.C. to let you know I am still in the land of the living and in stale old Brisbane. I am not settled but will write when I am as I am not sure when I will be going away. Tomorrow is your birthday and I sincerely wish you very many happy returns of the day and trust you are enjoying the best of health. I must conclude with -?. Best love to you all. You will get my address from Alex. I had a letter from Eva last week. Hope you will like the card. I remain your loving sister, Lilly.'.",
          "alt": "Observatory, Wickham Terrace, Brisbane, Queensland, ca. 1908.\nThe old windmill observatory on Wickham Terrace, Brisbane, around 1908. Four flags are flying on the mast in front of the mill. A lamp post and telegraph pole can be seen on the opposite corner. Copied from a postcard, the back of which reads: 'Dear Sister, Just a P.C. to let you know I am still in the land of the living and in stale old Brisbane. I am not settled but will write when I am as I am not sure when I will be going away. Tomorrow is your birthday and I sincerely wish you very many happy returns of the day and trust you are enjoying the best of health. I must conclude with -?. Best love to you all. You will get my address from Alex. I had a letter from Eva last week. Hope you will like the card. I remain your loving sister, Lilly.'.",
          "width": 1000,
          "height": 671,
          "mimeType": "image/jpeg",
          "license": "Public domain",
          "artist": "Unknown author",
          "sourceUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:StateLibQld_2_201211_Observatory,_Wickham_Terrace,_Brisbane,_Queensland,_ca._1908.jpg",
